LEG 4: TABLE A -- generic (non-Keller) field degree per box vs BKK
==============================================================================
BKK/hull formula (proved in report): N_max(dA,dB,dC) = (dC^2+dC*b+b^2)+(b^2+b*dA+dA^2),
b = max(dB,(dA+dC)/2); staircase (d,d+1,d+2): N_max = (d+2)^3 - d^3 = 6d^2+12d+8.
